6Summary:
Today’s session involved continuing the development of the Multi-Vendor E-commerce Platform with a focus on refining existing features and adding missing functionalities. Work was carried out on improving the integration between frontend and backend components, ensuring smoother data flow across the application. Additional enhancements were made to key features such as product handling and basic user interactions. The overall system was shaped to be more consistent and functional.

Outcomes:
The application progressed with improved feature completeness and better system integration. Existing functionalities became more stable and aligned with the project requirements. This step moved the project closer to a fully working system, setting up the next stages for testing and final improvements.
